# Cooperation Period Calculation

This scope calculates the expected end date of the cooperation period by adding a specified duration to the agreement's effective date.

```catala
declaration scope CooperationPeriod:
  input agreement_date content date   # The date the cooperation agreement was established
  input review_duration content duration # The duration for which cooperation is expected
  output end_date content date       # The calculated end date of the cooperation period
```

The end date of the cooperation period is determined by adding the review duration to the agreement date.

```catala
scope CooperationPeriod:
  date round down
  definition end_date equals agreement_date + review_duration
```